{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"508125","name":"杜林【逸闻】","desc":"杜林逸闻","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/eda6485c36013d85577cb1b4c9a8e0c2_628270769461069289.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e杜林\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e3月14日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e魔女会\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e在魔女M笔下诞生的龙，最终来到了人类的世界。而他的「故事」，也仍在继续。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/7adbbcee16df7088c22a9c0582f8a5e5_3144618028724845355.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/2189233da69c341b4d821a66d43f3d11_2578929246393211703.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"逸闻纪事·一","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e杜林·学习时间\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"简介\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e在挪德卡莱，你遇见了正在向阿贝多学习炼金术的杜林，希望他的学习一切顺利…\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e每累计获得10条任意角色的逸闻纪事，即可获得一次奖励：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"50\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*50\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/8fb9fa8eb6069551956797bf18c4ef10_5807855233800769791.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"逸闻纪事对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"l1y90os5yeiT1772447984258\",\"child_ids\":{\"6s9ed7qori3T1772448773845\":[],\"l1y90os5yeiT1772447984258\":[\"6s9ed7qori3T1772448773845\"]},\"contents\":{\"6s9ed7qori3T1772448773845\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：阿贝多，你在教他炼金术吗?\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e阿贝多：是的。毕竟在这个世界上，「炼金术」也算是「常识」之一了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e阿贝多：而且，杜林正好也对此有兴趣。虽然这里的…环境有些简陋，但教授一些简单的炼金术式还是足够了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e杜林：嗯，我把阿贝多教我式子都记下来了，有好多数字和符号，我学得很慢…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e阿贝多：对于学习这件事来说，学习速度的快慢并不关键，扎实踏好每一步才最重要。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e阿贝多：…材料似乎用得差不多了。我们先回去，再拿一点材料过来吧。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"l1y90os5yeiT1772447984258\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e阿贝多：…炼金过程就是如此。怎么样，要自己试试么？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e杜林：我…还是没记住刚才的式子，要是弄坏炼金台的话…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e阿贝多：这种小型的炼金，就算失败了，也仅仅会损毁材料而已。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e阿贝多：况且，损毁材料是炼金术学习里不得不经历的一环。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e本词条为\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(245, 34, 45)\\\"\u003e角色（逸闻）\u003c/span\u003e词条，若想查看角色，请点击\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"507241\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/11/24/50494840/7adbbcee16df7088c22a9c0582f8a5e5_3264399417008532150.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"杜林\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/507241/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/507241/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e杜林\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e。\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"8239","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":true,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"逸闻纪事·二","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e杜林·买书记\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"简介\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e在那夏镇，你遇见了正拜托雅珂达帮忙买书的杜林。在雅珂达的大力帮助下，杜林想买的书得到了一个大折扣…\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e每累计获得10条任意角色的逸闻纪事，即可获得一次奖励：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"50\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*50\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"9307","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"8174","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/04/50494840/211037a1e1001802168f914942cd810f_5026110044215689296.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"9306","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"8175","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"逸闻纪事对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"1u5q6fa5f4fT1772600151490\",\"child_ids\":{\"1u5q6fa5f4fT1772600151490\":[]},\"contents\":{\"1u5q6fa5f4fT1772600151490\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e雅珂达：那就这本，这本和这一本吧，居然都是旧书…喂，我们买这么多，记得打折啊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e雅珂达：还有后面那两本也一起打包吧。哎哟，反正放在那里那么久都没人买，我们买了，算半价吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e杜林：谢谢你，雅珂达…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e雅珂达：小事小事，不就买几本童话书嘛，我顺手就给你办了，我和你一起买书，还免得你被人宰一笔呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e雅珂达：不过小哥，你要这些书干嘛？自己看吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e杜林：嗯，我还想带给阿帽。他说不定也没看过这些书。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e雅珂达：行吧，你们俩关系可真好。书打包好了。你拿好，我还有事要办，先走了啊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e杜林：嗯，谢谢你，雅珂达。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e雅珂达：谢一遍就行了…咳，走了走了，回头见。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"9305","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"8176","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1793031781","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"475","tab_name":"基本信息","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"2520","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"8239","pos":"banner"},{"id":"8151","pos":"left"},{"id":"8155","pos":"right"}],"name":"基本信息","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"}]},{"tab_id":"488","tab_name":"逸闻纪事","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"2538","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"8174","pos":"left"},{"id":"8175","pos":"right"},{"id":"81